tation>Rebecca VW AG, Paraiso KH, Lawrence H, Gibney GT, Smalley KS. Vertical inhibition of the MAPK pathway enhances therapeutic responses in NRAS-mutant melanoma. Pigment Cell Melanoma es 2014;27:1154&#8211;8</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4211982</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25130256</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Morris EJ JS, Restaino CR, Dayananth P, Zhu H, Cooper A, et al. Discovery of a novel ERK inhibitor with activity in models of acquired resistance to BRAF and MEK inhibitors. Cancer Discov 2013;3:742&#8211;50</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">23614898</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Roberts PJ UJ, Darr DB, Dillon PM, Pfefferle AD, Whittle MC et al. Combined PI3K/mTOR and MEK inhibition provides broad antitumor activity in faithful murine cancer models. Clin Cancer Res 2012;18:5290&#8211;303</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC3715399</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">22872574</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Vu HL AA. Targeting TBK1 inhibits migration and resistance to MEK inhibitors in mutant NRAS melanoma. Mol Cancer Res 2014;12:1509&#8211;19</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4482471</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">24962318</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Vogel CJ SM, Maddalo G, Possik PA, Sparidans RW, van der Burg SH, et al. Cooperative induction of apoptosis in NRAS mutant melanoma by inhibition of MEK and ROCK. Pigment Cell Melanoma es 2015;28:307&#8211;17</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">25728708</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Posch C CB, Vujic I, Sanlorenzo M, Ma J, Kim ST, et al. Combined inhibition of MEK and Plk1 has synergistic antitumor activity in NRAS mutant melanoma. J Invest Dermatol 2015;135:2475&#8211;83</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC4567913</ArticleId><ArticleId IdT